name: [[.ChartName]]
description: A Krateo blueprint that provisions a Google Cloud [[.ServiceTitle]] [[.KccKind]] via Config Connector. Requires the Config Connector operator and Google Cloud credentials to be installed/configured beforehand (see repo docs).
type: application

# Drives the Composition CRD version (0.1.0 -> v0-1-0). Stamped by CI.
